    "title": "textPlus: Text Message + Call",
    "description": "Join more than 150 million others who have downloaded textPlus -  the best free second phone number app for unlimited texting and calling.\r\n\r\ntextPlus allows you to call, text, and message your friends with a real phone number or second phone number - no phone service required! \r\n\r\nSend free, unlimited SMS and MMS text now to any US phone number, or second phone number, and call nearly any phone number worldwide. That means you can reach all of your friends and family, even if they don\u2019t have the textPlus app installed.\r\n\r\nWHY TEXTPLUS?\r\n- Get a free local / second phone number of your choice.\r\n- Send and receive unlimited SMS / text / MMS / group messages to anyone from the US number.\r\n- Ad-supported local & international calling - you choose how to call!\r\n- Inbound and app to app calls are always free.\r\n\r\nDO MORE WITH TEXTPLUS:\r\n- Turn your tablet into a phone for unlimited text now and calls with a real US number or second phone number!\r\n- Great for keeping in touch with family / friends in the US / Canada while traveling abroad\r\n- Group texting / messaging / text and send unlimited MMS & SMS with US number\r\n- Toll-free calling from anywhere in the world with no restrictions!\r\n- Free unlimited inbound calling and calls - now friends can always reach you\r\n- Access your texting chat and text now or call history on all your devices with cloud hosting\r\n- Save tons of money now on your mobile plan\r\n- Send GIFs, emojis, and photos\r\n\r\nIS TEXTPLUS REALLY FREE?\r\nYes - FREE to send unlimited text messages, use second phone number, have inbound and app to app calls, and earn credits for other calls and texting.\r\n\r\nHOW IS TEXTPLUS FREE?\r\nThe app comes with a few ads. If you don't like it, you can purchase a subscription to remove them. Now there\u2019s even an option to watch videos to earn free credits and swap those credits to remove advertisements.\r\n\r\nGREAT PHONE ALTERNATIVE FOR:\r\n- anyone needing a free second number for work / privacy\r\n- seniors\r\n- travelers to and from the US\r\n- Heavy text senders\r\n- anyone looking to save money on cell phone bills \r\n\r\nCHEAP OR FREE INTERNATIONAL CALLING:\r\ntextPlus offers low-cost, international calls to every country in the world. There\u2019s now even an option to earn free calling credits by watching videos or completing offers. \r\n\r\nTEXTPLUS SUMMARY HIGHLIGHTS:\r\n- Full picture messaging (MMS texting): send, receive and save pictures\r\n- Customizable text tone, call ringtone & vibration for your second phone number\r\n- Customizable themes for your second phone number\r\n- Quick Reply to easily (and quickly) respond to friends text\r\n- Real SMS texting and calling, real second phone number: text now and call ANY phone that accepts SMS text, and ANY phone for calling.\r\n- Free Voicemail for missed calls\r\n- Works over WiFi or data\r\n\r\nFOLLOW TEXTPLUS\r\nwww.facebook.com/textplus\r\nwww.twitter.com/textplus\r\nQuestions? Email now: gethelp@textplus.com\r\n\r\nAds By Facebook\r\nRelevant advertisements may be visible based on the info you share on Social Media and your use of other websites and apps. To learn more: https://www.facebook.com/about/ads.\r\n\r\nLocation data may be used to provide more relevant advertisements.",
